                        ],
                        "form": "die Trias"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f828ac34-5c0c-31d0-b1d0-1a69940c6339",
                        "entry_id": "6efa41e4-4749-3ed2-983f-6168f573af4b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dreiheit, Gesamtheit, die aus drei Komponenten oder Elementen besteht"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "formal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3760a9c2-adae-434d-b512-7b43c7ec0921",
                                "sense_id": "f828ac34-5c0c-31d0-b1d0-1a69940c6339",
                                "text": "Auf zahlreichen figürlichen Monumenten aus römischer Zeit bildet dieser syrische Gott zusammen mit Venus und Merkur eine Trias."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f67395c-ea30-4c09-aa3a-b28a11297d34",
                                "sense_id": "f828ac34-5c0c-31d0-b1d0-1a69940c6339",
                                "text": "„Aber die Herrschaft der »langen Kerls« und Phallokraten ging zu Ende, als die Trias von Penicillin, Antibabypille oder der daraus resultierenden Emanzipation die Herren der Schöpfung zu solchen der Erschöpfung machte.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e30b681d-b394-3c41-a6b1-5522c2212b29",
                        "entry_id": "6efa41e4-4749-3ed2-983f-6168f573af4b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ältestes System des Mesozoikums (vor etwa 248 bis 214 Millionen Jahren)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "no-plural"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd734f15-19be-46cc-97b5-f74cca7e5efe",
                                "sense_id": "e30b681d-b394-3c41-a6b1-5522c2212b29",
                                "text": "„Diese fluvialen Sandsteine und Konglomerate sind von mächtigen Dolomitabfolgen mit eingeschalteten bituminösen Schiefern, von Flachwasserkalken und Evaporiten der Mittleren Trias überlagert.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "99ee0ec7-97d3-47b7-9363-89c2b08aacc1",
                                "sense_id": "e30b681d-b394-3c41-a6b1-5522c2212b29",
                                "text": "„Zur Zeit der Trias vor über 200 Millionen Jahren waren weite Teile West- und Mitteleuropas von einem großen Meer bedeckt.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fef74728-7c9d-3f8a-ac1c-a860026667ff",
                        "entry_id": "6efa41e4-4749-3ed2-983f-6168f573af4b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "gemeinschaftliches Auftreten dreier Symptome"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "74cb9d18-124a-4470-9a7b-2e2a95aec2da",
                                "sense_id": "fef74728-7c9d-3f8a-ac1c-a860026667ff",
                                "text": "Die Trias aus Arthritis, Urethritis und Konjunktivitis wird als Reiter-Syndrom oder Morbus Reiter bezeichnet."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d94d7000-e651-499d-a2fa-fa02616a1d99",
                        "source_entry_id": "6efa41e4-4749-3ed2-983f-6168f573af4b",
                        "source_sense_id": "e30b681d-b394-3c41-a6b1-5522c2212b29",
                        "source_sense_description": "ältestes System des Mesozoikums (vor etwa 248 bis 214 Millionen Jahren)",
                        "target_lang_word": "Triassic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Triassic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37359a6e-dfd8-3711-b751-c0f330c477cb",
                                        "entry_id": "f4b2aaaa-ebfa-3887-a8f4-260f3129d82e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or from the geologic strata above the Permian and below the Jurassic; of or belonging to the period 250 to 200 million years ago when these strata were laid down."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7428e899-698e-403e-b7a7-8eef7768d1d1",
                                                "sense_id": "37359a6e-dfd8-3711-b751-c0f330c477cb",
                                                "text": "“Well,” Ellie said. “We know animals have survived. Crocodiles are basically Triassic animals living in the present. Sharks are Triassic. So we know it has happened before.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Triassic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5635b14-56f2-36dd-9a71-9c79502bfb72",
                                        "entry_id": "378b5f3e-6ac2-312e-ae0a-c98e0fe0a783",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A geologic period within the Mesozoic era, comprising lower, middle and upper epochs from about 250 to 200 million years ago."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b462feaf-c1ff-409f-b58a-09e997f7623c",
                                                "sense_id": "b5635b14-56f2-36dd-9a71-9c79502bfb72",
                                                "text": "Fossils are particularly well described from the Carboniferous, Triassic, Jurassic and Cretaceous periods and have been found in the USA, England, Russia, Lebanon and Germany. Sites such as Lyme Regis in Dorset have particularly yielded number of Jurassic “squid” ink sacs and nodules (Doguzhaeva et al. 2004)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "11c474e9-adcb-4b97-bb18-3353e413e0ea",
                        "source_entry_id": "6efa41e4-4749-3ed2-983f-6168f573af4b",
